---
source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Fleet quarantine control plane (local file transport, or a live HTTP coordinator)

Usage: franken-node fleet <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status     Show fleet and quarantine state from the configured store
  describe   Describe one node from the configured fleet store
  release    Lift quarantine[PATH] controls with receipts
  reconcile  Reconcile the fleet-action log; timeout fails closed
  agent      Poll fleet actions and push heartbeats: the local durable store, or a live coordinator when `[fleet] control_plane_url` is configured
  serve      Serve this node's durable fleet store as the live HTTP control plane that agents and operators on other nodes connect to
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
